{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-seminar-hall-booking-api",
    "name": "Seminar Hall Booking API",
    "description": "REST API for the Seminar Hall Booking System (Go/Gin backend).\n\n## Setup\n1. Set collection variable **baseUrl** (default `http://localhost:8080`).\n2. Run **Auth → Login** with a valid user; the **Tests** tab saves `token` from the response.\n3. Protected folders inherit **Bearer Token** `{{token}}` (same as `Authorization: Bearer` accepted by the API; cookie `auth_token` also works from browsers).\n\n## Roles\n- **Requester**: create/list own requests.\n- **dept_coordinator**: dept queue, dept review, faculties, classes.\n- **admin**: full management, reports, bookings, users, departments, halls, clubs.\n\nSource: `backend/internal/router/router.go`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "hall_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "request_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "booking_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "dept_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "class_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "club_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "availability_date", "value": "2026-04-19" },
    { "key": "range_start", "value": "2026-04-01" },
    { "key": "range_end", "value": "2026-04-30" }
  ],
